# Work Log

Keep this file in reverse-chronological order: newest entries first.

- This file records completed work, verification results, and short handoff summaries.
- Do not use it for the active next step; keep that in `current-task.md`.
- Keep one work log per runtime instance. Shared durable findings belong in shared memory, not this local log.
- This file is workspace-local in Slock mode and agent-home-local in CLI mode.
- Durable reusable findings should be promoted to shared memory through pamem governance.
